    "language": "[0]Okay. So in this situation, I need to figure out who I'm going to pass the ball to. Uh, the best person to pass the ball to in this situation is the left striker because the defender right now is not really covering the path to the left striker, so I'm going to go ahead and pass the ball to him. After I do that, I need to then move to another position to act as the left striker's support. (breathing)[1][2] [3]Now I have passed the ball to the left striker and moved to the better position as the striker's support, and then the left striker can then choose to either pass it back to me or take it to the goal, or to another teammate. And the reason why... Oh, hold on. (breathing)",
